[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4322.87, "timestamp": "01:12:02", "text": "最终，为了给他人带来幸福。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4331.75, "timestamp": "01:12:11", "text": "你戏弄我的那次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4334.99, "timestamp": "01:12:14", "text": "你说勒索者是救星，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4338.39, "timestamp": "01:12:18", "text": "。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4351.149, "timestamp": "01:12:31", "text": "他们没能被救回来。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4353.55, "timestamp": "01:12:33", "text": "这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4356.83, "timestamp": "01:12:36", "text": "这并不是因为他们自己做出了选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4359.669, "timestamp": "01:12:39", "text": "蚊子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4365.27, "timestamp": "01:12:45", "text": "嗯？就像你当时试图阻止我一样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4370.03, "timestamp": "01:12:50", "text": "你也在做出你认为最好的选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4373.83, "timestamp": "01:12:53", "text": "你和他们一样，都希望接触到尽可能多的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4378.11, "timestamp": "01:12:58", "text": "他们努力确保人们能够生存下去。"}]